<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Biblica® Open Efik Living New Testament</book>
  <para style="rem">Copyright © 1995 by Biblica, Inc.</para>
  <para style="h">Filemọn</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ñwed Filemọn</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filemọn</para>
  <para style="toc3">Filem</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ñwed Filemọn</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Ñwed emi oto Pọl owo ñkpọkọbi ke ntak Kraist Jisọs, ye Timoti. Iwet ñwed emi inọ ufan ñnyin ye nsaña utom ñnyin Filemọn <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />ye ufọk Abasi emi esobode ke ufọk fo; ye eyen eka ñnyin añwan, Apfia, ye owo nsaña ekọñ ñnyin Akipọs:<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Yak Abasi Ete ñnyin ye Ọbọñ Jisọs Kraist ọnọ fi mfọn ye emem.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pọl Ebeñe Mfọnido</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Kpukpru ini emi ami mbọñde akam, eyen ete mi Filemọn, ami nsasiak enyiñ fo ñnyuñ nnọ Abasi mi ekọm. <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />Koro ami mokop mbaña ima emi afo enyenede abaña kpukpru ikọt Abasi, ye mbuọtidem emi afo enyenede ke Ọbọñ Jisọs. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Akam mi edi yak ebuana emi ñnyin inyenede ye afo nte mme andinim ke akpanikọ ada ntọtuñọ ediyarade edi emi otukde kpukpru edidiọñ emi ñnyin inyenede ke uwem ñnyin ke Kraist. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Ima fo, edima eyen ete mi, ama ada akamba inemesit ye uwak idọñesit ọsọk mi. Afo amanam esit ofuri ikọt Abasi ekop idara.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Ke ntak emi ami mekeme ndinyene uko emi ekemde, nte eyen ete fo ke Kraist, ke ndidọhọ fi anam se anade nte afo anam. <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />Edi ima enyik mi ndibeñe. Ami nnam ntem okposuk edi emi edide ami Pọl, isuñutom Kraist Jisọs, ke emi ndide owo ñkpọkọbi ke ntak Esie. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Do ami nnam ebeñe nnọ fi kabaña Onesimọs, emi edide eyen mi ke Kraist, koro ini emi ami ñkodude ke ufọk ñkpọkọbi ke ami ñkedi ete esie ke se iketukde ñkpọ spirit. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Enyene ini emi enye mikọwọrọke ñkpọ inọ fi, edi idahaemi enye enyene udori ọnọ fi ye ami nde. <verse eid="PHM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Ami ke nnam enye afiak ebine fi, ndien esit mi asaña ye enye.<verse eid="PHM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Ami ñkpamama ndinam enye odu mi ye ami, kadaña emi ami ndude ke ñkpọkọbi, ke ntak Eti Mbuk emi, man otodo enye ekeme ndidi uñwam nnọ mi ke ibuot fo. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Nte ededi, ami ñyomke ndinyenyik fi ndiñwam mi; edi ñkpoyom fi anam ntre oto ke ima esit fo. Ke ntem ami ndinamke ñkpọ ndomokiet tutu afo enyime. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Ekeme ndidi nte Onesimọs ọkọkpọñ fi ke esisit ini, man afo ọkpọtọñọ ntak enyene enye kpukpru ini. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Ndien idahaemi, enye idighe ofin ikpọñ, enye edi se ikande ofin: enye eyedi edima eyen ete ke Kraist. Ñkemeke nditiñ se enye edide ọnọ mi, ye se enye edidide inọ fi, nte ofin ye eyen ete ke Ọbọñ.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Do edieke afo ekerede abaña mi nte nsaña utom fo, fiak da enye nyene kpa nte afo akpadade mi. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Edieke enye ekeduede fi mme akanamde fi ñkpọ kiet ekededi, bat nọ mi. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Ami ñwet emi ke ubọk ñwed mi: Ami Pọl ñyekpe fi. (Ikpanaha ami nti fi nte ke afo amakama mi isọn ofuri uwem fo).<verse eid="PHM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Ke ntre, eyen ete mi; nam ufọn emi nọ mi, ye ke ntak Ọbọñ, nam esit mi adat, nte eyen ete ke Kraist.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Ami menim ke akpanikọ, nte ke ndiwet ñwed emi, ke afo eyenam se mbeñede fi — ke ofuri akpanikọ, nte ke ndiwet ñwed emi, ke afo eyenam akan se mbeñede fi oro.<verse eid="PHM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Ñkpọ efen ñko, ami ñyom fi etim ubet kiet enim ọnọ mi, koro ami menim ke akpanikọ nte ke Abasi eyeyere akam mbufo, onyuñ afiak ayak mi ọnọ mbufo.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafras emi odude ke ñkpọkọbi ye ami ke ntak Kraist Jisọs ọnọ ekọm esọk fi, <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />kpa ntre ñko, ye mme nsaña utom mi, Mak Aristakọs, Demas, ye Luk.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Yak mfọn Ọbọñ Jisọs Kraist odu ye spirit fo.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>